# Design System

- Build UI from shared tokens/components, not one-off page styles.
- Tokenize color, type, space, radius, elevation, motion, state.
- Reuse buttons/inputs/modals/tables/alerts; minimize arbitrary colors and meaningless class names.
- Same semantics → same component/language/color meaning across screens.
- Keep design docs current; update CODEMAP when the system changes.

